[en.IDEA_C12_PROSPEROUS_FARM]
Prosperous Farm

[en.IDEA_C12_PROSPEROUS_FARM_desc]
Hidden beneath the layers of rock, rich resources are being excavated, and new factories are springing up, creating opportunities everywhere. Our unemployment rate has dropped to unprecedented levels, and the economy is growing at an exponential rate.

[zh.IDEA_C12_PROSPEROUS_FARM]
繁荣的农场

[zh.IDEA_C12_PROSPEROUS_FARM_desc]
藏在岩层下的丰富资源被挖掘，新的工厂拔地而起，到处都是商机。我们的失业率降到了前所未有的水平，而经济在以几何速度增长。
